# SDD Methodology References

Spec: SddReferencesIndex
Purpose:
  Entry point for SDD methodology reference documents synthesized from
  industry research and the ECC framework integration.

Owns: references/sdd/INDEX.sdd

Contents:
  best-practices.sdd:   Curated SDD best practices (Three Levels, Core Workflow, EARS)
  tool-comparison.sdd:  Industry SDD tool landscape (Cosmos, Kiro, Spec Kit, OpenSpec, BMAD, Cursor)
  ears-notation.sdd:    EARS (Easy Approach to Requirements Syntax) reference
  ecc-framework-overview.sdd: Everything-Claude-Code framework summary
  living-specs-best-practices.sdd: Living spec lifecycle, organizational memory, verification

ReadOrder:
  1  @best-practices.sdd
  2  @tool-comparison.sdd
  3  @ears-notation.sdd
  4  @ecc-framework-overview.sdd
  5  @living-specs-best-practices.sdd

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  BestPractices: @best-practices.sdd
  ToolComparison: @tool-comparison.sdd
  EarsNotation: @ears-notation.sdd
  EccFramework: @ecc-framework-overview.sdd
  LivingSpecs: @living-specs-best-practices.sdd
  Concepts: @../../concepts/INDEX.sdd
  EvolutionPolicy: @../../policies/evolution.sdd

State: +
